WEBVTT

00:02:00.449 --> 00:02:04.579
But a condition that most of us, sadly,
will be familiar with --

00:02:04.579 --> 00:02:07.039
Alzheimer's disease --

00:02:07.081 --> 00:02:09.041
tells us something quite different.

00:02:10.418 --> 00:02:13.880
Alzheimer's begins
by affecting short-term memory.

00:02:15.173 --> 00:02:18.092
Think about what that does
to someone's story.

00:02:18.968 --> 00:02:21.512
In order for our stories to form, to grow,

00:02:21.554 --> 00:02:25.808
something that just happens to us
has to first enter short-term memory,

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:27.268
and then, get incorporated

00:02:27.268 --> 00:02:30.438
into what's called
long-term episodic memory.